<title>CHILE: TENNIS-CHILE BEAT ARGENTINA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHILE BEAT ARGENTINA 3-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile beat Argentina 3-2 in their Davis Cup American zone group one second round tie Sunday after the reverse singles rubbers:</p>
<p>Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 6-4 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Javier Frana (Argentina) beat Gabriel Silberstein (Chile) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
